  npcID: capitan_tinong
  displayName: Capitan Tinong
  characterFullName: Tinong
  alias: None
  characterCategory: Filipino Elite / Civilian Guest
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  description: "A friendly and prosperous Filipino acquaintance of Capit\xE1n Tiago.
    He warmly welcomes Ibarra and invites the newly returned young man to visit his
    home."
  biography: "Capit\xE1n Tinong approaches Ibarra shortly after the young man introduces
    himself to the other guests. He explains that he is a friend of Capit\xE1n Tiago
    and that he knew Don Rafael Ibarra. Tinong invites Cris\xF3stomo to dine at his
    house in Tondo, although Ibarra must decline because he plans to leave for San
    Diego the following morning. His cheerful reception provides a sharp contrast
    to Fray D\xE1maso\u2019s hostility."
  characterFacts:
  - He lives in Tondo.
  - "He is a friend of Capit\xE1n Tiago."
  - "He warmly welcomes Cris\xF3stomo home."
  - He invites Ibarra to dine at his house.
  - He is described as smiling and amiable.
  - He wears native-style clothing with diamond shirt studs.
